      <link>https://www.prohousingpgh.org/blog/new-report-modernizing-property-tax-assessments-in-allegheny-county</link>
      <description>📝 New Report: Modernizing Property Tax Assessments in Allegheny County Jul 7 Written By Jack Billings Allegheny County has not conducted periodic, regular property reassessments since the 1970s. Today, Pro-Housing Pittsburgh is releasing our latest report:Modernizing Property Tax Assessments in Allegheny County This report examines how modern, open-source assessment methods could be used to produce fair, transparent, and affordable countywide reassessments. Regular reassessments could likely be performed in-house by Allegheny County for approximately $1 million per year, far below the costs often associated with court-ordered reassessments.

